#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Chihiro"
msgid "Okay, this match is for keeps."
msgstr "Esta bien, este partido es para siempre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Player"
msgid "Heh. You take this seriously, don't you?"
msgstr "Je. Eres del tipo competitivo, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Chihiro"
msgid "Let's go in."
msgstr "Entremos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Chihiro"
msgid "Okay, this match is for keeps."
msgstr "Esta bien, este partido es para siempre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Talk_Yes"
msgid "Come on, let's go in."
msgstr "Vamos, entremos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Player"
msgid "Hold on a sec... Um, looks like I'm low on cash."
msgstr "Un segundo... Mmm, parece que no tengo dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Chihiro"
msgid "What? You are!?"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¡¿En serio?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Player"
msgid "Yeah. Sorry."
msgstr "Sí. Lo siento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Chihiro"
msgid "That's a shame. I guess that's it today.\\r\n\\r\nGoodbye for now."
msgstr "Es una pena. Supongo que esto será todo por hoy.\\r\n\\r\nNos vemos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Player"
msgid "(I better find some money...)"
msgstr "(Será mejor que encuentre algo de dinero...)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Chihiro"
msgid "Oh, I lost. You could've gone a bit easier on me!"
msgstr "Oh, perdí. ¡Podrías haber sido un poco más indulgente conmigo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Player"
msgid "Hey, you said it was for keeps."
msgstr "Ey, dijiste que era para siempre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Chihiro"
msgid "Yeah, I did. And I had fun, too. I'll just have to practice! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Sí, lo hice. Y me divertí. ¡Tendré que mejorar con la práctica! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Chihiro"
msgid "I'll be waiting for you at the club."
msgstr "Te estaré esperando en el club."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Chihiro"
msgid "Looks like a draw."
msgstr "Parece que terminamos empatando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Player"
msgid "Yeah. You're pretty good."
msgstr "Si. Eres bastante bueno."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Chihiro"
msgid "Thank you! That was intense, wasn't it?"
msgstr "¡Gracias! Eso estuvo muy peleado, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Talk_Ojigi"
msgid "Well, I'll see you at the club."
msgstr "Genial. Entonces, te veré en el club."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Chihiro"
msgid "I did it! I beat you!"
msgstr "¡Lo hice! ¡Le gané!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Player"
msgid "Yep, you sure did."
msgstr "Sip, me has ganado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Chihiro"
msgid "That was fun! Darts is great, isn't it?"
msgstr "¡Eso fue divertido! Los dardos son la bomba, ¿No le parece?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
